# N5.4: a replay. The first game in the list for about 20 seconds with some buttons, back to the
# menu (the game is kept as a replay), then Replays, the newest one, watched to the end. The
# log says "replay: ended at frame ..., as recorded" when it ran exactly as the game did.
wait 6000
expect menu
tap a
wait 9000
expect game
tap a
wait 800
tap b
wait 800
tap x
wait 1500
tap a
wait 3000
tap rb
wait 2000
tap a
wait 2000
tap guide
wait 500
expect pause
tap down 7
tap a
wait 2500
expect menu
# Replays: the menu below the five games, the ninth entry
tap down 5
tap down 8
tap a
wait 800
expect replays
shot
tap a
wait 3000
expect game
wait 26000
shot
tap guide
wait 500
expect pause
tap down 7
tap a
wait 2000
expect menu
quit
